liblz4 1.10.0 by Yann Collet (BSD-2-Clause).

The `stuffr` binary's lz4 compatibility family
(crates/stuffr-cli/src/compat/lz4/) behaves as the LZ4 command line
interface 1.10.0. liblz4 1.10.0 is linked on the `lz4-c` tier (through
`lz4-sys`, by `stuffr-formats`); the pure tier's frame writer follows
liblz4's doc/lz4_Frame_format.md. The lz4 command line itself
(programs/, GPL-2.0-or-later) was not read: this family is a clean-room
implementation from its documentation (the man page, NEWS, README, `-h`
and `-H`) and its observed behaviour. The licence of liblz4 follows,
copied verbatim from lz4 1.10.0's lib/LICENSE.

